# The catalog cannot be read at launch (the fake gateway's /models answers 503
# for its first six seconds), a turn starts and keeps streaming, and `/model`
# asks again while it runs: fx starts the load on a thread of its own at once
# (`ensureModelCache` from `openModelBrowseCatalog`,
# `app_input_runtime.zig:2346-2349`) and the open menu takes the rows when they
# land (`pollLoadTransition`, `model_cache_runtime.zig:549-557`).
models models.json
modelsdown 6000
gateway model-reask-turns.json
wait 2.5
snap start
type /model
key Enter
wait 1
snap menu-failed
key Escape
wait 0.5
type say something
key Enter
wait 4
snap turn-running
type /model
key Enter
wait 2
snap reask-midturn
gwlog
